  </div>

  <div class="tile-game" data-tile-builder data-answer="the notebook is small and black" data-hint="Begin with The notebook is, then connect the two qualities with and." data-fix="The notebook is small and black." data-success-message="Correct. After be, and connects the two qualities small and black.">
    <h3>Drill 4: describe the same notebook after <em>be</em></h3>
    <p class="tile-target">The notebook has both qualities. Build the complete sentence, then say it.</p>
    <div class="tile-bank" data-build-bank>
      <button class="tile" data-build-tile="black">black</button>
      <button class="tile" data-build-tile="the">The</button>
      <button class="tile" data-build-tile="and">and</button>
