    </div>
    <p class="feedback" data-feedback></p>
  </div>

  <div class="tile-game" data-tile-builder data-answer="the office is big" data-hint="Begin with The office, add is, and place the adjective after be." data-fix="The office is big." data-success-message="Correct. Big comes after is when the noun phrase The office is the subject.">
    <h3>Drill 5: build with <em>be</em></h3>
    <p class="tile-target">Now put the adjective after <em>be</em>. The office is large. Build the sentence.</p>
    <div class="tile-bank" data-build-bank>
