  </div>

  <div class="tile-game" data-tile-builder data-answer="i have a new phone" data-hint="Begin with I have, then place the article and adjective before the noun." data-fix="I have a new phone." data-success-message="Correct. A new phone keeps the article and adjective together before the noun.">
    <h3>Drill 6: build the sentence</h3>
    <p class="tile-target">Use an invented phone: it is new. Build the sentence, then say it.</p>
    <div class="tile-bank" data-build-bank>
      <button class="tile" data-build-tile="phone">phone</button>
      <button class="tile" data-build-tile="i">I</button>
      <button class="tile" data-build-tile="new">new</button>
      <button class="tile" data-build-tile="have">have</button>
      <button class="tile" data-build-tile="a">a</button>
    </div>
    <div class="build-area" data-build-area data-placeholder="Tap words in order"></div>
    <div class="drill-actions">
