  <section id="next-day-retrieval" data-lesson-extension="Five-minute next-day adjective retrieval">
    <h2>Next-day retrieval</h2>
    <div class="lead-rule"></div>
    <p>Keep the main lesson closed. Retrieve article choice, plural agreement, two-adjective order, and the pattern after <em>be</em>.</p>

    <div class="practice" data-choice-gap-drill data-success-message="Correct. You recalled an before old, unchanged black with a plural noun, and after be, and size before color.">
      <h3>Choose the exact description from memory</h3>
      <div class="choice-bank" aria-label="Next-day adjective choices">
        <button class="choice-option" data-choice-option="a">a</button>
        <button class="choice-option" data-choice-option="an">an</button>
        <button class="choice-option" data-choice-option="black">black</button>
        <button class="choice-option" data-choice-option="blacks">blacks</button>
        <button class="choice-option" data-choice-option="and">and</button>
        <button class="choice-option" data-choice-option="or">or</button>
        <button class="choice-option" data-choice-option="small black">small black</button>
        <button class="choice-option" data-choice-option="black small">black small</button>
      </div>
      <div class="q"><span class="n">1</span><span>This is <button class="choice-gap" data-choice-gap data-answer="an" data-hint="Old begins with a vowel sound." data-fix="This is an old watch." data-placeholder="choose">choose</button> old watch.</span></div>
      <div class="q"><span class="n">2</span><span>Those are two <button class="choice-gap" data-choice-gap data-answer="black" data-hint="The plural ending belongs on bags; the color adjective stays unchanged." data-fix="Those are two black bags." data-placeholder="choose">choose</button> bags.</span></div>
      <div class="q"><span class="n">3</span><span>The notebook is small <button class="choice-gap" data-choice-gap data-answer="and" data-hint="Both qualities are true, so connect them with and." data-fix="The notebook is small and black." data-placeholder="choose">choose</button> black.</span></div>
      <div class="q"><span class="n">4</span><span>I found a <button class="choice-gap" data-choice-gap data-answer="small black" data-hint="Before the noun, place size before color." data-fix="I found a small black notebook." data-placeholder="choose">choose</button> notebook.</span></div>
      <div class="drill-actions">
        <button class="lesson-btn" data-check-choices>Check</button>
        <button class="lesson-btn" data-reset-choices>Reset</button>
      </div>
      <p class="feedback" data-feedback></p>
    </div>

    <div class="micro-drill" data-spot-error data-answer="is" data-hint="The subject cars is plural, so check the form of be." data-fix="The cars are red." data-why="Use are with the plural subject the cars. The adjective red does not change.">
      <h3>Repair the agreement</h3>
      <p>The cars is red. Tap the form of <em>be</em> that does not agree with the plural subject.</p>
      <div class="spot-options">
        <button class="error-choice" data-error-choice="cars">cars</button>
        <button class="error-choice" data-error-choice="is">is</button>
        <button class="error-choice" data-error-choice="red">red</button>
      </div>
      <p class="hidden-answer" data-error-feedback></p>
    </div>

    <div class="micro-drill" data-transform>
      <h3>Say it without choices</h3>
      <p>Describe one invented singular object before a noun, then after <em>be</em>. Make it plural and change only the article, noun, and form of <em>be</em>. Keep both adjectives unchanged.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="thinking-card">
      <h3>Thirty-second production</h3>
      <p>Describe one fictional lost item with a size or age, a color, and a label or location. Ask your teacher to identify it, then confirm the complete noun phrase.</p>
    </div>
